1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
 Why is AI trading the future?

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:05,000
 Hedge funds have traded with algorithms for decades.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,880
 They had three things you didn't:

4
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,680
 the data, the engineers, and the computers.

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,360
 Now, everyday traders make up

6
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,360
 of a third of all U.S. stock trading.

7
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:15,840
 A record number, more people than ever,

8
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:18,680
 still going up against machines by hand.

9
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:21,800
 I helped launch TikTok in Australia and New Zealand,

10
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,680
 from zero to two million daily active users.

11
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,080
 I've seen this movie before.

12
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,760
 The tools only the pros had

13
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:30,320
 suddenly landed in everyone's pocket.

14
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,520
 That's happening to trading right now.

15
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,880
 Cloud computing, open source AI,

16
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,680
 and AI that writes the code for you.

17
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:39,680
 The three things hedge funds pay millions for

18
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:41,920
 just got cheap, and they're getting cheaper.

19
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,680
 That's why we built Cube.

20
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,120
 You type your trading idea in plain English

21
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,480
 the way you explain it to a friend.

22
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:50,520
 Cube writes the code, pulls the data across the market,

23
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:53,440
 and runs the backtest, results, and signals

24
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:54,440
 right in front of you.

25
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,840
 When it looks good, test it on a paper account.

26
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:59,440
 When you're ready, take a life through a real broker.

27
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:02,040
 One place, idea to execution.

28
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:04,000
 Hedge funds needed a whole quantity for them.

29
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,760
 You need one idea.

30
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:07,960
 Common Cube, and I'll send you the full breakdown.

